      {
        "id": "p14-q8-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{3x+3}{2x}\\times\\frac{x^2}{x^2-1}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{3x}{2(x-1)}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3x+3}{2x}\\times\\frac{x^2}{x^2-1}&=\\frac{3(x+1)}{2x}\\times\\frac{x^2}{(x-1)(x+1)}\\\\\\frac{3x+3}{2x}\\times\\frac{x^2}{x^2-1}&=\\frac{3x}{2(x-1)}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-q8-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{a^2+a-2}{a+2}\\times\\frac{a^2-3a}{a^2-4a+3}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{a^2+a-2}{a+2}\\times\\frac{a^2-3a}{a^2-4a+3}&=\\frac{(a+2)(a-1)}{a+2}\\times\\frac{a(a-3)}{(a-1)(a-3)}\\\\\\frac{a^2+a-2}{a+2}\\times\\frac{a^2-3a}{a^2-4a+3}&=a\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-q8-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{c^2+5c+6}{c^2-16}\\div\\frac{c+3}{c-4}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{c+2}{c+4}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{c^2+5c+6}{c^2-16}\\div\\frac{c+3}{c-4}&=\\frac{c^2+5c+6}{c^2-16}\\times\\frac{c-4}{c+3}\\\\\\frac{c^2+5c+6}{c^2-16}\\div\\frac{c+3}{c-4}&=\\frac{(c+2)(c+3)}{(c-4)(c+4)}\\times\\frac{c-4}{c+3}\\\\\\frac{c^2+5c+6}{c^2-16}\\div\\frac{c+3}{c-4}&=\\frac{c+2}{c+4}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 46
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-q8-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{x^2-x-20}{x^2-25}\\times\\frac{x^2-x-2}{x^2+2x-8}\\div\\frac{x+1}{x^2+5x}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x$\n\nMultiply by the reciprocal of the divisor, factor completely and cancel common factors.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2-x-20}{x^2-25}\\times\\frac{x^2-x-2}{x^2+2x-8}\\div\\frac{x+1}{x^2+5x}&=\\frac{x^2-x-20}{x^2-25}\\times\\frac{x^2-x-2}{x^2+2x-8}\\times\\frac{x^2+5x}{x+1}\\\\\\frac{x^2-x-20}{x^2-25}\\times\\frac{x^2-x-2}{x^2+2x-8}\\div\\frac{x+1}{x^2+5x}&=\\frac{(x-5)(x+4)}{(x-5)(x+5)}\\times\\frac{(x-2)(x+1)}{(x+4)(x-2)}\\times\\frac{x(x+5)}{x+1}\\\\\\frac{x^2-x-20}{x^2-25}\\times\\frac{x^2-x-2}{x^2+2x-8}\\div\\frac{x+1}{x^2+5x}&=x\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 58
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-q8-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{ax+bx-2a-2b}{3x^2-5x-2}\\times\\frac{9x^2-1}{a^2+2ab+b^2}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{3x-1}{a+b}$\n\nFactor the first numerator by grouping, then cancel common factors.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{ax+bx-2a-2b}{3x^2-5x-2}\\times\\frac{9x^2-1}{a^2+2ab+b^2}&=\\frac{x(a+b)-2(a+b)}{(3x+1)(x-2)}\\times\\frac{(3x-1)(3x+1)}{(a+b)^2}\\\\\\frac{ax+bx-2a-2b}{3x^2-5x-2}\\times\\frac{9x^2-1}{a^2+2ab+b^2}&=\\frac{(a+b)(x-2)}{(3x+1)(x-2)}\\times\\frac{(3x-1)(3x+1)}{(a+b)^2}\\\\\\frac{ax+bx-2a-2b}{3x^2-5x-2}\\times\\frac{9x^2-1}{a^2+2ab+b^2}&=\\frac{3x-1}{a+b}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 46
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-q8-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{2x^2+x-15}{x^2+3x-28}\\div\\frac{x^2+6x+9}{x^2-4x}\\div\\frac{6x^2-15x}{x^2-49}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{x-7}{3(x+3)}$\n\nWork from left to right, multiplying by each divisor's reciprocal before cancelling common factors.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2x^2+x-15}{x^2+3x-28}\\div\\frac{x^2+6x+9}{x^2-4x}\\div\\frac{6x^2-15x}{x^2-49}&=\\frac{2x^2+x-15}{x^2+3x-28}\\times\\frac{x^2-4x}{x^2+6x+9}\\times\\frac{x^2-49}{6x^2-15x}\\\\\\frac{2x^2+x-15}{x^2+3x-28}\\div\\frac{x^2+6x+9}{x^2-4x}\\div\\frac{6x^2-15x}{x^2-49}&=\\frac{(2x-5)(x+3)}{(x+7)(x-4)}\\times\\frac{x(x-4)}{(x+3)^2}\\times\\frac{(x-7)(x+7)}{3x(2x-5)}\\\\\\frac{2x^2+x-15}{x^2+3x-28}\\div\\frac{x^2+6x+9}{x^2-4x}\\div\\frac{6x^2-15x}{x^2-49}&=\\frac{x-7}{3(x+3)}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 58
      }
